{"unit_id":"hollowfyh__dsh-plugin-doctor#feature-1","repo":"hollowfyh/dsh-plugin-doctor","commit":"7804671db0ef21a871a9652dc5dd41479c3b499e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-doctor 的功能「失败插件扫描」：周期读取插件清单，统计活跃与加载失败的条目，并将启用但未挂载的条目单独列入诊断报告。 触发方式为后台扫描或 /doctor 命令。诊断状态写入本机报告，修复操作追加到记录文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:76-95","lib/index.js:187-228"]}
{"unit_id":"hollowfyh__dsh-plugin-doctor#feature-2","repo":"hollowfyh/dsh-plugin-doctor","commit":"7804671db0ef21a871a9652dc5dd41479c3b499e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-doctor 的功能「自动禁用失败项」：后台扫描发现失败条目后调用宿主管理器禁用符合条件的项目，并跳过只读或受保护条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:230-303"]}
